;; placeholders (region_disasm.gc lines 81, 219, 262-268) rather than jak3's renamed
;; debug-no-zbuf1/debug, since jakx has not named those buckets yet and jak3's
;; PC_PORT region-enter-color/region-exit-color debug-menu machinery
;; (goal_src/jak3/pc/pckernel-impl.gc:245-289) does not exist in jakx. Everything
;; else below is byte-for-byte identical between the two games' decodes.

;; definition for method 8 of type drawable-region-prim
